    "Request repair uses pending-bound seed/frontier/terminal sets, indexed original holders and a byte-capped 64KiB result cache. It does not allocate a per-request file or whole-history ID map. Displacement chains are replayed for uncached lookups rather than retained."
  ],
  "notAccepted": [
