    "Displacement repairs do not yet add historical holders outside changedSources to request token-summary remeasurement. Mapping replay therefore does not establish correct mandatory estimates for arbitrary earlier-tail displacement.",
    "No new assertion-failing/restored mutation controls were executed.",
    "Occupied-slot actual public HTTP fresh-settings/eviction/pop/clone/compaction/reopen cross-product is not newly established. Existing focused lifecycle files pass only their executed cases.",
    "Warm 40/4000 exact physical-cost receipts were not refreshed; previous metadata/ROW/LENS measurements are historical. No fused cold fill, 100000-call capacity, global live/unreachable-byte accounting or fresh full native memory/traps claim.",
    "Kimi/Responses/Anthropic production migration, native log/dump, wider media provenance cross-products and phase 5/6/W26 completion remain open. Original tools 170s RED and separate pre-existing REDs are unchanged."
  ],
